    m_Localized: Jedi Monkey - Total War
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 289108850511880
    m_Localized: "Est un : Partie rapide, 2D Cartoon\r\nJ'ai d\xE9velopp\xE9 :\r\n-
      Les interfaces\r\n- Le game flow\r\n- Le gamefeel (Slow motion, camera shake,
      post-process)\r\n- L'audio\r\n\r\nCeci est un jeu issu de la Random Title Jam
      2023.\r\n"
